"creator/commit/9133b1516>`__\\ ), với thư viện chia sẻ ``libpython3.13`` và "
"``ujson`` gốc (\\ `d3aa663d8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d3aa663d8>`__\\ , `a2cb24e74 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a2cb24e74>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:317
msgid ""
"**Bundled language server:** ``pylsp`` with astroid 3.3.5 on Windows, macOS,"
